## Phase 3 — Dashboard Tab System (Horizontal Scroll)

### Goal
Fix tabs overflow — chuyển từ wrap sang horizontal scroll. Tối ưu tab rendering.

### Changes

#### [MODIFY] [Component_VPPRequest.razor](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/Components/Pages/VPPRequest/Component_VPPRequest.razor)
