## Phase 8 — Responsive Polish (4 Breakpoints)

### Goal
Responsive tối ưu cho 4 kích thước: mobile, small laptop, desktop, wide desktop. Full-width stretch.

### Breakpoints
```
Mobile:        < 768px    — sidebar overlay, bottom nav
Small Laptop:  768-1199px — sidebar collapsed (icon-only)
Desktop:       1200-1599px — sidebar expanded
Wide Desktop:  1600px+    — sidebar expanded, content stretch
```

### Changes

#### [MODIFY] [vpp-responsive.css](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/wwwroot/css/vpp-responsive.css)
- Add 1600px breakpoint for wide desktop
- Bỏ max-width constraints → full-width everywhere
- Mobile: sidebar overlay + bottom nav
- Small laptop: sidebar collapsed
- DataGrid: horizontal scroll on small screens
- KPI cards: responsive grid (1-2-3-4 columns)

#### [MODIFY] [vpp-layout.css](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/wwwroot/css/vpp-layout.css)
- Layout grid adjustments for 4 breakpoints
- Content area: full-width, remove max-width

#### [MODIFY] [MainLayout.razor](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/Components/Layout/MainLayout.razor)
- Verify responsive classes applied

### Review Checklist (test each breakpoint)
- [ ] Mobile (375px): sidebar overlay, bottom nav, cards stacked
- [ ] Small laptop (768px): sidebar collapsed, 2-col cards
- [ ] Desktop (1200px): sidebar expanded, 3-4 col cards
- [ ] Wide desktop (1920px): full-width stretch, no wasted space
- [ ] DataGrid: horizontal scroll on small screens

