## Phase 9 — Final Polish & Cleanup

### Goal
Micro-animations, hover effects, cleanup unused code, overall consistency.

### Changes

- **Hover effects**: all cards, buttons, menu items
- **Page transitions**: subtle fade-in
- **Skeleton loading**: verify all loading states
- **Toast notifications**: polish styling
- **Cleanup**: remove dead CSS, unused components
- **Empty states**: verify EmptyState component used everywhere
- **vpp-polish.css**: final adjustments

### Review Checklist
- [ ] All hover effects smooth
- [ ] No dead CSS
- [ ] Consistent spacing throughout
- [ ] No visual regressions
- [ ] Build passes: `dotnet build`

---

## Verification Plan

### After Each Phase
```bash
# 1. Build check
dotnet build gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe.csproj

# 2. Run app
dotnet run --project gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe.csproj

# 3. Browser check (tôi sẽ chụp screenshot)
# 4. User review trên browser (F12 → Device Toolbar)
```

### User Review Workflow
Sau mỗi phase:
1. Tôi chụp screenshot qua browser tool
2. Bạn mở app trên browser → kiểm tra visual
3. Bạn test responsive bằng F12 → Device Toolbar
4. Bạn confirm OK hoặc yêu cầu chỉnh sửa
5. Chỉ khi bạn approve mới chuyển phase tiếp

### Breakpoint Testing Guide
| Size | Device Toolbar Preset |
|------|----------------------|
| 375px | iPhone SE |
| 768px | iPad Mini |
| 1200px | Laptop (custom) |
| 1600px | Desktop (custom) |
| 1920px | Full HD (custom) |

---

## Radzen MCP Usage Strategy

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Bắt buộc** query Radzen Blazor MCP trước mỗi phase để lấy chính xác API, properties, best practices.

### Per-Phase MCP Queries
| Phase | Query Topics |
|-------|-------------|
| 1 | CSS variables, theme customization |
| 2 | RadzenPanelMenu, RadzenSidebar, collapse |
| 3 | RadzenTabs overflow, scroll |
| 4 | RadzenCard, RadzenDataGrid nested |
| 5 | RadzenDataGrid LoadData, virtualization |
| 6 | Conditional rendering, RadzenSwitch |
| 7 | RadzenSteps, RadzenDataGrid checkbox |
| 8 | RadzenColumn responsive, RadzenLayout |
| 9 | General polish patterns |

---

## Out of Scope (Separate Plans)

- ❌ Charts & data visualization → plan riêng
- ❌ Report page → plan riêng (cùng với charts)
- ❌ Login page redesign → giữ nguyên
- ❌ Backend optimization (DB indexes, pagination API) → plan riêng
- ❌ i18n resource keys mới → thêm khi cần trong mỗi phase
- ❌ Accessibility audit → phase riêng sau khi UI ổn định
